2 CONC 四朝佚聞 ''Ssu-ch'ao i-wên''; [https://www.geni.com/people/LCM/6000000048153342067 Li Tz'û-ming] [q.v.], ''Yüeh-man t'ang jih-chi''; ''Hsi-hsün ta-shih chi'' (see under [https://www.geni.com/people/YX/6000000009796676885 I-hsin]); Tso
