2 CONC üan'' 2, 3; Johnston, R.F., ''Twilight in the Forbidden City'' (1934), chapters 1-6; Wu Yung 吳永, ''The Flight of an Empress'' (1936), translated by Ida Pruitt; [https://www.geni.com/people/Der-Ling-Lizzie/6000000002666054499 Der L
2 CONC ing], ''Two Years in the Forbidden City'' (1911); [https://www.geni.com/people/Sarah-Conger/6000000013707853627 Conger, Sara P.], ''Letters from China'' (1909); Headland, I.T., ''Court Life in China'' (1909); Carl, Katharine A., '
2 CONC 'With the Empress Dowager'' (1905); Malone, C.B., ''History of the Peking Summer Palaces Under the Ch'ing Dynasty'' (1934), pp. 194-218; See also bibliographies under [https://www.geni.com/people/YX/6000000009796676885 I-hsin], [h
2 CONC ttps://www.geni.com/people/RL/6000000009796689882 Jung-lu], and [https://www.geni.com/people/SS/6000000009823430303 Su-shun].] 
2 CONT
