2 CONC ibrary of Peiping'', vol. 7, nos. 3-4 (May-Aug. 1934); ''Ch'ou-pan I-wu shih-mo'', ''Hsien-fêng'', ''T'ung-chih'', passim; [https://www.geni.com/people/W-A-P-Martin/6000000058335059846 Martin, W. A. P.], ''A Cycle of Cathay'' (189
