2 CONC  ''Peking and the Pekingese'' (1865), vol. 1, p. 221; Grant, H., ''Incidents of the China War of 1860'' (1875); [https://www.geni.com/people/Henry-Brougham-Loch-1st-Baron-Loch-GCB-GCMG/6000000001744265100 Loch, H. B.], ''Personal 
2 CONC Narrative of Occurrences during Lord Elgin's Second Embassy to China, 1860'', 3d ed. (1900); M'ghee, R. J. L., ''How We Got to Peking'' (1862) ; Lane-Poole, ''Life of Sir Harry Parkes'', 2 vols. (1894); [https://www.geni.com/peopl
2 CONC e/DX/6000000058335104062 Tung Hsün] [q.v.], ''Nien-p'u'', 2/46b; Bland and Backhouse, ''China under the Empress Dowager'' (1910), portrait of Tsai-ying opposite p. 252; [https://www.geni.com/people/LCM/6000000048153342067 Li Tzû-m
2 CONC ing] [q.v.], ''Yüeh-man t'ang jih-chi''.] 
